.TP
.B ppk compose\-env initramfs.toml \-p dev.peios.ppk@0.1.0\-1 \-\-out initramfs
The same, with
.B ppk
added to the profile's packages.
.TP
.B ppk run \-p net.busybox.busybox@1.37.0\-1
Start the shell that the busybox package provides, in an environment
whose
.I /usr
is that package's closure.
